; background: transparent; line-height: 28px;\">Self referrals, fraudulent transactions, suspected Affiliate fraud.</li></ul><p style=\"margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent; color: rgb(75, 82, 99); line-height: 28px; font-family: proxima-nova, \" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">In addition to the foregoing, MIS reserves the right to terminate any Affiliate account at any time, for any violations of this Agreement or no reason.</p><h3 style=\"margin: 40px 0px 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent; color: rgb(65, 73, 91); font-family: proxima-nova, \" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\"><span class=\"ez-toc-section\" id=\"4_Affiliate_Links\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent;\"></span>4. Affiliate Links<span class=\"ez-toc-section-end\" style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent;\"></span></h3><p style=\"margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent; color: rgb(75, 82, 99); line-height: 28px; font-family: proxima-nova, \" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif;\"=\"\">You may use graphic and text links both on your website and within in your email messages. You may also advertise the MIS site in online and offline classified ads, magazines, and newspapers.</p><p style=\"margin-top: 16px; margin-bottom: 16px; padding: 0px; border: 0px; outline: 0px; font-size: 18px; vertical-align: baseline; background: transparent; color: rgb(75, 82, 99); line-height: 28px; font-family: proxima-nova, \" helvetica=\"\" neue\",=\"\" helvetica,=\"\" arial,=\"\" sans-serif